{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/TITLE_STEAM-1_EN.png?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Easy to enter, fun to master controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/Hub_Players.gif?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/TITLE_STEAM-2_EN.png?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add style to every game! Customize everything from appearance to accessories, and create your favorite plushie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/CharacterAccessories_opt.gif?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/CharacterSkins_opt.gif?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/TITLE_STEAM-3_EN.png?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Plush Party, there's never a dull moment. When the claw catches you, become one yourself and chase down your rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/ClawGif.gif?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feature list: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accesible controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stage diversity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play along with up to 8 friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Less than a minute rounds.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266120?t=1745751915","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266120?t=1745751915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/f41ba53e3d8c6546f8654dbff5de5e23fdb5b15b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745751915","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/f41ba53e3d8c6546f8654dbff5de5e23fdb5b15b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745751915","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/TITLE_STEAM-1_EN.png?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Easy to enter, fun to master controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/Hub_Players.gif?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/TITLE_STEAM-2_EN.png?t=1745751915\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add style to every g